2026-10-20, macOS 15.7.3, CUA native app scroll API.
Disposable fixture InputProbe.scrollWheel records NSEvent.scrollingDeltaX/Y,
hasPreciseScrollingDeltas, phase, and momentumPhase in its Accessibility value.

fixture.scroll(probe, 'right', 1):
x=0.0 y=0.0 precise=true phase=0 momentum=0
fixture.scroll(probe, 'left', 10):
x=0.0 y=0.0 precise=true phase=0 momentum=0
fixture.scroll(probe, 'down', 1):
x=0.0 y=-500.0 precise=true phase=0 momentum=0

The native automation API emits zero horizontal deltas. This does not establish
physical trackpad behavior. The production view's in-memory NSEvent lifecycle
checks are recorded separately in desktop-checks.log.
